# Cargo's build output for the shell; its own workspace, so its own target.
/src-tauri/target/
# Generated by tauri-build from the capabilities and the Tauri crates.
/src-tauri/gen/
# The app binary copied in for bundling (README: 打包本地二进制). Built from the
